sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant AG as API Gateway
    participant CO as create_order Lambda
    participant GO as get_order Lambda
    participant DB as DynamoDB
    participant Q as SQS order_queue
    participant PP as process_payment Lambda
    participant SNS as SNS Topic
    participant N as notify Lambda

    C->>AG: POST /orders
    AG->>CO: Invoke
    CO->>DB: put_item (status=PENDING)
    CO->>Q: send_message
    CO-->>AG: {order_id, status: PENDING}
    AG-->>C: 201 Created

    Q->>PP: Trigger
    PP->>DB: update_item (status=COMPLETED or FAILED)
    PP->>SNS: publish
    SNS->>N: Trigger

    C->>AG: GET /orders/{order_id}
    AG->>GO: Invoke
    GO->>DB: get_item
    DB-->>GO: Item
    GO-->>AG: {order_id, status, ...}
    AG-->>C: 200 OK
